                        "sense_id": "6ee7f38c-275e-38dd-b03b-7021cd17acd2",
                        "entry_id": "e558920a-5bb7-3e46-a19d-f78cad064f13",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a cheerful manner; with a cheery demeanour."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "646bb5c9-6327-4a8a-961f-36df8fd4b777",
                                "sense_id": "6ee7f38c-275e-38dd-b03b-7021cd17acd2",
                                "text": "Having already dismissed the story as a heap of piffle, he cheerily advised the reporters to go for a run."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d7958d6-41e6-47cf-abfa-d3a3b9d2a0bb",
                                "sense_id": "6ee7f38c-275e-38dd-b03b-7021cd17acd2",
                                "text": "Matters stood thus in the Castle of Avenel, when a winded bugle sent its shrill and prolonged notes from the shore of the lake, and was replied to cheerily by the signal of the warder."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7885c547-a549-4527-a2a5-10906ea1a4f4",
                                "sense_id": "6ee7f38c-275e-38dd-b03b-7021cd17acd2",
                                "text": "What, perhaps, with other things, made Stubb such an easy-going, unfearing man, so cheerily trudging off with the burden of life in a world full of grave peddlers, all bowed to the ground with their packs; […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
